  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the canned chickpeas, coconut milk, apple cider vinegar, and soy sauce.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and braise the curry for 20 minutes.",
    "Season the curry with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or noodles."
